<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>The 5 Axiom Brain Quiz</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0b0f19;
            --card-bg: #151c2c;
            --accent-purple: #6366f1;
            --accent-cyan: #06b6d4;
            --text-main: #f8fafc;
            --text-sub: #94a3b8;
            --border-color: #2e3a52;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, #1e1b4b 0%, var(--bg-color) 70%);
            color: var(--text-main);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .quiz-card {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 40px;
            max-width: 650px;
            width: 100%;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .header-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent-purple), var(--accent-cyan));
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .progress-bar-container {
            width: 100%;
            height: 6px;
            background-color: var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 3px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .progress-bar {
            height: 100%;
            width: 0%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent-purple), var(--accent-cyan));
            transition: width 0.3s ease;
        }

        .question-title {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        .question-subtitle {
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: var(--text-sub);
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .options-grid {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 14px;
        }

        .option-btn {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            padding: 18px 20px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-align: left;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .option-btn:hover {
            background: var(--accent-purple);
            border-color: var(--accent-purple);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);
        }

        .results-container {
            display: none;
        }

        .results-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .results-body {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: var(--text-sub);
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .restart-btn {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent-purple), var(--accent-cyan));
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-radius: 10px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
        }

        .restart-btn:hover {
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="quiz-card">
    <div id="quiz-view">
        <div class="header-badge">The 5 Axiom Brain Quiz</div>
        <div class="progress-bar-container">
            <div class="progress-bar" id="progress"></div>
        </div>
        <h2 class="question-title" id="question-title">Loading Question...</h2>
        <p class="question-subtitle" id="question-subtitle"></p>
        <div class="options-grid" id="options"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="results-container" id="results-view">
        <div class="header-badge">Assessment Complete</div>
        <h2 class="results-title">Your Brain Profile Is Ready</h2>
        <p class="results-body" id="results-text">Based on your responses across all 5 axioms, your cognitive baseline emphasizes structured logic, analytical processing, and systematic problem solving.</p>
        <button class="restart-btn" onclick="restartQuiz()">Retake Assessment</button>
    </div>
</div>

